VALUES (1160003, 'tt23642744', NULL, 'Night of the Hunted', 'Night of the Hunted', 'movie', 2023, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tfNFmBGBVF1biwOTBgFONAeCaDZ.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7lWaPb80r6BsL9V436Cgs6SYklb.jpg', 'When an unsuspecting woman stops at a remote gas station in the dead of night, she''s made the plaything of a sociopath sniper with a secret vendetta. To survive, she must not only dodge his bullets and fight for her life, but also figure out who wants her dead and why.', NULL, NULL, 4.6537, 6.129, 0, 9.51, '2026-10-17 04:47:13', '2026-10-17 04:47:13')
