VALUES (4476, 'tt0110322', NULL, 'Legends of the Fall', 'Legends of the Fall', 'movie', 1994, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t1KPGlW0UGd0m515LPQmk2F4nu1.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eVIuBKpeLB8rkozkj8bVmxDuAsp.jpg', 'In early 20th-century Montana, Col. William Ludlow lives on a ranch in the wilderness with his sons, Alfred, Tristan, and Samuel. Eventually, the unconventional but close-knit family are bound by loyalty, tested by war, and torn apart by love, as told over the course of several decades in this epic saga.', NULL, NULL, 8.2321, 7.4, 0, 3.55483870967741921e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-10-17 04:47:13')
