VALUES (8066, 'tt0371257', NULL, 'Stay', 'Stay', 'movie', 2005, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrLZVP8jG0KBcabahRPp6UP7Oy2.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eUNQJ0XKHoGDDQzj1Y4WhE5zAFJ.jpg', 'Psychiatrist Sam Foster has a new patient, Henry Letham, who claims to be suicidal. In trying to diagnose him, Sam visits Henry''s prior therapist and also finds Henry''s mother -- even though Henry has said that he murdered both of his parents. As reality starts to contradict fact, Sam spirals into an unstable mental state. Then he finds a clue as to how and when Henry may try to kill himself, and races to try to stop him.', NULL, NULL, 4.4688, 6.6, 0, 3.15289285714285725e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-10-17 04:47:13')
