VALUES (748853, 'tt13429362', NULL, 'In the Earth', 'In the Earth', 'movie', 2021, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2e9GLb14xX1DFv80nsioci5Zld.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fjRlDPqo2qqMBoUItMtTDZe9kvZ.jpg', 'As a deadly virus ravages the world, Dr. Martin Lowery embarks on a mission to reach test site ATU327A, a research hub deep in the Arboreal Forest. The arduous journey, guided by park scout Alma, is set back by a nighttime attack that leaves the two bruised and shoeless. When they run into Zach, a man living off the grid, they gratefully accept his help. Zach’s intentions aren’t exactly what they seem, however, and a path out of the forest and into safety quickly fades as the line between myth and science blurs.', NULL, NULL, 1.2304, 5.596, 0, 1.06133333333333332e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-10-17 04:47:13')
