VALUES (152584, 'tt2278871', NULL, 'Blue Is the Warmest Color', 'La Vie d''Adèle - Chapitres 1 et 2', 'movie', 2013, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgUk1wti2cvrptIgUz0VTAtSF6w.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bEmPrq7Y4MubVATOCtOacY3eXQ5.jpg', 'Adèle''s life is changed when she meets Emma, a young woman with blue hair, who will allow her to discover desire, to assert herself as a woman and as an adult. In front of others, Adele grows, seeks herself, loses herself, finds herself.', NULL, NULL, 6.2713, 7.072, 0, 1.35914285714285725e+01, '2026-07-20 01:02:04', '2026-10-17 04:47:13')
