VALUES (19666, 'tt0169102', NULL, 'Lagaan: Once Upon a Time in India', 'लगान', 'movie', 2001, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNX9lFRAFeNLNRIXdqZK9gYrYKa.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/76VwduxQMkVXOUktps85dE0lLeP.jpg', 'The year is 1893 and India is under British occupation. In a small village, the tyrannical Captain Russell has imposed an unprecedented land tax on its citizens. Outraged, Bhuvan, a rebellious farmer, rallies the villagers to publicly oppose the tax. Russell offers a novel way to settle the dispute: he challenges Bhuvan and his men to a game of cricket, a sport completely foreign to India. If Bhuvan and his men can defeat Russell''s team, the tax will be repealed.', NULL, NULL, 3.1333, 7.273, 0, 10.51, '2026-08-27 07:35:55', '2026-10-17 04:47:13')
